<BaseLayout title="Terms" description="Draft website terms for the SWEEP Schools rebuild preview. Requires school and legal review before publication." noIndex={true}>
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Website information</span><h1>Website terms</h1><p>This draft is provided for review and is not a final school-approved legal notice.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container prose"><h2>Information accuracy</h2><p>Information shown in this preview is based in part on the existing public SWEEP Schools website. Fees, operating times, curriculum information, admissions requirements, staff details and contact information may change and must be confirmed directly with the school.</p><h2>Admissions</h2><p>Submitting an enquiry or contacting the school does not constitute an application, guarantee admission or confirm that a place is available.</p><h2>Images and content</h2><p>Existing school images and content are referenced for design and content-mapping purposes. Rights, permissions, attribution and any required learner or parent consent must be confirmed before the site is published.</p><h2>Approval</h2><p>These terms must be reviewed and approved by the authorised school representative before any production launch.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>